DESCRIPTION:Preacher Lawson is a stand-up comedian\, actor\, and creator kn
 own for his high-energy storytelling and physical\, joy-driven comedy. He 
 first gained national attention as a finalist on America’s Got Talent an
 d has since built a global fanbase through touring\, social media\, and mu
 ltiple comedy specials. Preacher headlines clubs and theaters across the w
 orld\, selling out shows with material that blends sharp observations\, fam
 ily stories\, and fearless honesty.Raised in a military family and shaped 
 by life on the move\, Preacher’s comedy centers on resilience\, relation
 ships\, and finding humor in chaos. Beyond stand-up\, he creates digital c
 ontent\, develops film and TV projects\, and collaborates with other comed
 ians and creators. His work has been featured on NBC\, Netflix Is a Joke\,
  and major comedy festivals\, and his independently released specials have
  reached millions online.With a loyal audience and an unmistakable stage pr
 esence\, Preacher continues to expand from stand-up into storytelling acro
 ss film\, documentary\, and unscripted projects—most recently chroniclin
 g life on the road with his family in his first documentary feature.\nMore
